-- =====================================================================================
-- BACKUP / CHECKPOINT (run in Hasura -> Data -> SQL BEFORE any repair). Hasura can't pg_dump,
-- so we snapshot exactly the affected rows into plain tables (idempotent: dropped+recreated).
-- Covers all 984 corrupt bridge_deposits + the 6 boundary holders (= 990 rows).
-- To roll everything back, run rollback_from_backup.sql.
-- =====================================================================================
